  {
    "uuid": "e7bae56a-52db-5597-a111-f3aefb3526ab",
    "entry": "介音",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "かいおん",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "medial",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [
            {
              "text": "中国語音韻学では、声母と主母音の間に置かれる介音が音節構造を複雑にする。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "「ian」という音節では「i」が介音として機能し、主母音「a」への滑らかな移行を作る。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "古代中国語の再構成において、介音の有無が方言間の音対応を説明する鍵となる。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "Illusions AI",
                "author": "Claude",
                "note": "claude-sonnet-4-6"
              }
            }
          ],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "おもえばおふたりが御えんぐみをあそばしてから、ことしで足かけ六ねんと申すみじかいおんちぎりでござります。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "盲目物語",
                "author": "谷崎潤一郎",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    ],
